# The Other Side of Truth (Q115), last part: a level 53 character on cond 9 that lost Kierre's report
# gets another, gives it to Rafforty (cond 10), has no piece of the tablet (cond 11), takes one from a
# sculpture (cond 12) and Rafforty finishes the quest with 60040 adena; then relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q115_the_other_side_of_truth_finish.golden
character Seeker 53
quest Q115_TheOtherSideOfTruth <cond>=9 <state>=STARTED
script quest.Q115_TheOtherSideOfTruth
